### 6. Database: Minor Schema Update

#### Supabase `generated_bullets` table

```sql
ALTER TABLE generated_bullets 
ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS generation_group_id UUID DEFAULT NULL;
```

This column is nullable and optional. When bullets are saved from a Section Composer batch, they all share the same `generation_group_id` (a UUID generated client-side). This lets us show a subtle "Generated as part of a group" indicator in the Point Bank.

